% at IDR8,500. Profit-taking hits cigarette maker \uc2 Gudang Garam\uc2  (GGRM.JK) down 0.7% at IDR35,300. (edhi.pranasidhi@dowjones.com) [ 08-13-10 0143ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100813e68d0003h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
