\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar hits 15-year low vs yen after Fed move\b0\par\par\uc2 547 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 2010\par 09:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Dollar hits 15-year low vs yen at 84.72 yen\par \par \uc2 * U.S. 2-yr yields fall after Fed steps to revive economy\par \par \uc2 * Euro, riskier \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  fall vs dlr, yen as equities lose ground\par \par \uc2 (Updates lead, prices, adds quote)\par \par \uc2 By Neal Armstrong\par \par \uc2 LONDON, Aug 11 (Reuters) - The dollar fell to a 15-year low against the yen on Wednesday as steps taken by the Federal Reserve to revive a faltering U.S. economy pushed U.S. Treasury yields lower.\par \par \uc2 Japanese Finance Minister Yoshihiko Noda said on Wednesday that he was closely watching \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but analysts doubted his rhetoric would escalate into \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs the support of the U.S. and Europe to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the Fed and the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are focused on other problems right now so I don't think it is possible at these levels," said Manuel Oliveri, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at \uc2 UBS\uc2  in Zurich.\par \par \uc2 The dollar dropped to 84.72 yen on trading platform EBS, after taking out option barriers at 85.00 and 84.75, in a move fuelled by U.S. two-year Treasury yields hitting a record low.\par \par \uc2 "I see no upside for dollar/yen right now and I can see it falling towards 80 yen," said Oliveri.\par \par \uc2 The record low in dollar/yen was hit in April 1995 around 79.75 yen.\par \par \uc2 In a move to reinvigorate a weakening economic recovery, the Fed said on Tuesday it would use cash from maturing mortgage bonds it holds to buy more government debt to help pin down borrowing costs.\par \par \uc2 The move strengthened expectations that U.S. interest rates would stay at record lows, driving U.S. two-year yields to a record low and narrowing the spread over Japanese two-year yields, which pushed the dollar down against the yen.\par \par \uc2 "The fall in U.S. yields is a barometer of the cyclical position of the U.S. economy," said Adam Cole, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at RBC.\par \par \uc2 "The market's reaction is that if the U.S. economy is slowing materially it will not be in isolation and it has therefore responded by selling risk instead of selling the dollar, which is positive for the yen."\par \par \uc2 SHARES FALL\par \par \uc2 The dollar rose against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investors pared back their exposure to risk, pushing the U.S. unit up 1 percent against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as European shares fell 1.2 percent.\par \par \uc2 At 1146 GMT the dollar had gained more than 1 percent to 81.645, its strongest since late July, as the euro lost 1.3 percent to $1.3000 and the Australian dollar slid 1.2 percent to $0.9030.\par \par \uc2 The yen gained across the board, with the euro down more than 2 percent and the Aussie losing 1.7 percent as equity market falls encouraged investors to shun risk in favour of the low-yielding Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, sterling fell more than 1 percent against the dollar after the Bank of England said UK inflation would fall well below its 2 percent target in two years even if interest rates stay low. (Additional reporting by Jessica Mortimer; Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 5)|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100811e68b000mi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
